### Snort + Bug Bounty: Advanced Website Security Testing

Yes. You can combine Snort, Wireshark, Burp Suite, Nmap and browser developer tools to improve your bug bounty investigations.

However, one important thing to understand:

Snort does not directly discover every website vulnerability. It monitors network traffic and detects suspicious patterns. Burp Suite and other web-testing tools help you investigate application vulnerabilities.

The strongest approach is to combine them so that you can observe, intercept, analyse and understand website traffic.

Only test domains and systems explicitly included in your bug bounty programme's scope.

